Name the regular file that owns each physical block number inside an ext2/3/4 or f2fs image (blocks no file uses print as none)

Usage: android-doctor icheck [OPTIONS] <IMAGE> <BLOCKS>...

Arguments:
  <IMAGE>      
  <BLOCKS>...  

Options:
      --json      Print JSON instead of text
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
